"""SignSetu language layer: ISL gloss sequence -> natural English + Hindi sentences, real-life scenarios,
quick phrases and the encouragement engine used by Learn & Practice.

ISL is not English word-by-word: it is topic-comment, often verb/question-final and drops the copula
("ME DOCTOR WHERE" = "Where is the doctor?"). `compose()` is a small, deterministic, fully offline rule
engine that covers the patterns our 300-sign vocabulary can express. `polish_with_claude()` is an optional
upgrade used only when ANTHROPIC_API_KEY is set; the app always falls back to the offline result.
"""
